we open it up to the public?

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:11.360 align:start position:19%
Any questions on his recommendations?
Okay. Uh let's open the the discussion

00:14:09.279 --> 00:14:15.880 align:start position:19%
up to the public. Anyone in the room? Uh
would you like to discuss the proposed

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:15.880 align:start position:19%
items?

